,null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"Growth should bring opportunity. Not more chasing."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"Sales has one number. The warehouse has another. Finance is waiting for both. As a business grows, the gaps between departments become harder to manage. OneSpace helps you close those gaps—with an ERP implementation shaped around your people, your processes, and the decisions you need to make."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"FOLLOW ONE ORDER"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"From a promise to a complete picture."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead t-muted","children":"A connected workflow, configured around the way your business delivers."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"journey-track","children":[["$","li","A customer says yes",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":["0",1]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"A customer says yes"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Capture the quotation, agreed terms, and order without losing the context of the sale."}]]}],["$","li","The operation gets moving",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":["0",2]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"The operation gets moving"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Check availability, plan purchasing or production, and give the next team a clear handover."}]]}],["$","li","Finance sees the full picture",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":["0",3]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"Finance sees the full picture"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Connect delivery, invoicing, and payment so the figures can be traced back to the work."}]]}],["$","li","Leaders know what comes next",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"story-index","children":["0",4]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"Leaders know what comes next"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Review exceptions, overdue items, and performance using agreed reports and consistent records."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"YOUR STARTING POINT"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"What needs to change first?"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-cards","children":[["$","$L5","Build your first connected system",{"className":"story-card","href":"/onespace/implementation","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"Build your first connected system"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Move beyond disconnected tools with a phased ERPNext implementation and a clear data plan."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"story-textlink","children":["Plan an implementation"," ↗"]}]]}],["$","$L5","Make your current ERP work better",{"className":"story-card","href":"/onespace/support","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"Make your current ERP work better"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Find the causes behind unreliable reports, repeated work, and low adoption. Prioritise the fixes."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"story-textlink","children":["Explore a system review"," ↗"]}]]}],["$","$L5","Connect the missing pieces",{"className":"story-card","href":"/onespace/integrations","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"Connect the missing pieces"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Bring websites, specialist applications, and Egyptian e-invoicing into a defined workflow."}],["$","span",null,{"className":"story-textlink","children":["Explore integrations"," ↗"]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-platform","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"THE PLATFORM / THE PARTNERSHIP"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"ERPNext at the core. Your business in focus."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-lead","children":"Open-source ERP brings connected capabilities. OneSpace brings the discovery, implementation, integrations, and adoption work that makes them useful to your team."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Already considering Odoo or Oracle? We can discuss platform fit, product editions, and total ownership costs against your requirements."}],["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/onespace/erpnext","className":"story-textlink","children":"Understand the platform →"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-section","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"EXPLORE ONESPACE"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-h2","children":"The detail behind the decision."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-directory","children":[["$","$L5","industries",{"href":"/onespace/industries","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"t-mono","children":["0",1]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"INDUSTRIES"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A warehouse, a factory, and a project team ask different questions. Start with the work that makes your business distinctive, then connect it to a dependable financial and operational foundation."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"↗"}]]}],["$","$L5","implementation",{"href":"/onespace/implementation","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"t-mono","children":["0",2]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"IMPLEMENTATION & MIGRATION"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"An ERP project changes how people work together. We plan the process, data, testing, and adoption as carefully as the software itself."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"↗"}]]}],["$","$L5","integrations",{"href":"/onespace/integrations","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"t-mono","children":["0",3]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"INTEGRATIONS & E-INVOICING"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Connect the moments between your ERP, sales channels, and specialist tools. Give each integration clear data ownership, useful status visibility, and a plan for exceptions."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"↗"}]]}],["$","$L5","support",{"href":"/onespace/support","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"t-mono","children":["0",4]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"t-h3","children":"SUPPORT & IMPROVEMENT"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"New people join. Processes change. Reports need to answer new questions. Give your ERP a structured path for support, maintenance, and improvement after launch."}]]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"↗"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"story-section","aria-labelledby":"questions-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"story-section__head","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"t-eyebrow","children":"BEFORE WE BEGIN"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"questions-heading","className":"t-h2","children":"Good questions. Clear answers."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"story-faq","children":[["$","details","What is OneSpace?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["What is OneSpace?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"OneSpace is Nest Software Development’s ERP service brand. We help businesses select, implement, adapt, and support business systems. ERPNext is a core route; Odoo and Oracle requirements can also be discussed during platform selection."}]]}],["$","details","Is OneSpace a separate ERP product?",{"children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":["Is OneSpace a separate ERP product?",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"+"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"OneSpace is the service relationship around your ERP project. The underlying pla